      "cluster_id": 3,
      "headline_hint": "US enacts law imposing tariffs on India over Russian oil imports",
      "section": "india",
      "batch_position": 0,
      "claim_count": 13,
      "distinct_outlets": 3,
      "source_kinds": {
        "fulltext": 13
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": 37,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "U.S. President Donald Trump signed into law the Lindsey O. Graham Sanctioning Russia and Iran Act, 2026.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/how-will-the-uss-sanctioning-act-affect-india-explained/article71485870.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The Act permits the U.S. to impose a 100% tariff on imports from countries that continue to import crude oil or natural gas from Russia 30 days after its enactment.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/how-will-the-uss-sanctioning-act-affect-india-explained/article71485870.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The Act originally aimed to cut off funding for Russia's war in Ukraine by sanctioning top Russian leadership and major energy customers.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/how-will-the-uss-sanctioning-act-affect-india-explained/article71485870.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The text of the Act was amended to extend sanctions on Iran for another five years until 2031.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/how-will-the-uss-sanctioning-act-affect-india-explained/article71485870.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "Russia accounted for more than 51% of India's crude oil imports in July 2026.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/how-will-the-uss-sanctioning-act-affect-india-explained/article71485870.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "India faces an existing 10% tariff under Section 301 of the Trade Act of 1974 and a 50% tariff under Section 232 of the Trade Expansion Act of 1962.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "The Hindu",
          "url": "https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/how-will-the-uss-sanctioning-act-affect-india-explained/article71485870.ece",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "Union Minister of State for External Affairs Kirti Vardhan Singh stated that India considers the U.S. tariffs very unfair and will buy energy from commercially viable and economical sources independently.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/trump-tariffs-unfair-india-will-buy-energy-from-commercially-viable-sources-says-mos-amid-russia-iran-sanctions-law-11789828160506.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The White House confirmed President Trump signed H.R. 5334, the Lindsey O. Graham Sanctioning Russia and Iran Act of 2026, into law on Friday, September 18, 2026.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/trump-tariffs-unfair-india-will-buy-energy-from-commercially-viable-sources-says-mos-amid-russia-iran-sanctions-law-11789828160506.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The legislation cleared the U.S. Senate with an 86-11 vote in August and passed the House of Representatives 262-159.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/india/trump-tariffs-unfair-india-will-buy-energy-from-commercially-viable-sources-says-mos-amid-russia-iran-sanctions-law-11789828160506.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "Republican Senator Lindsey Graham, who spearheaded the bill, died in July 2026.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Scroll.in",
          "url": "https://scroll.in/latest/1095849/trump-signs-bill-allowing-100-tariffs-on-india-other-countries-for-buying-russian-oil?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=public",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "India's Ministry of External Affairs stated that New Delhi is committed to ensuring energy security through diversified sourcing and market dynamics, and will take all necessary steps to protect its economic interests.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Scroll.in",
          "url": "https://scroll.in/latest/1095849/trump-signs-bill-allowing-100-tariffs-on-india-other-countries-for-buying-russian-oil?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=public",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The Trump administration imposed a 25% punitive tariff on India in August 2025 over Russian oil imports, which Trump removed in February 2026 following an interim trade deal.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Scroll.in",
          "url": "https://scroll.in/latest/1095849/trump-signs-bill-allowing-100-tariffs-on-india-other-countries-for-buying-russian-oil?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=public",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "India's Russian oil imports reached an 11-month high in April 2026 following the U.S. and Israel war on Iran, after dropping to a 38-month low in December 2025.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Scroll.in",
          "url": "https://scroll.in/latest/1095849/trump-signs-bill-allowing-100-tariffs-on-india-other-countries-for-buying-russian-oil?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=public",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
